
### Get all Organizers
GET https://pluginapi.onrender.com/api/organizers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjY3MjZhOWI4ZmNjZDk0OTdhNTFjMjVkOSIsImVtYWlsIjoiZWhtYWVzc2llbkBnbWFpbC5jb20iLCJpYXQiOjE3MzIxMDk0MTUsImV4cCI6MTczNDcwMTQxNX0.RBUjWyXGFviM9EieUILjZaVQZJo-9HmJmphHlZIDVV8

